{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"poker-odds-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"id","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"poker-odds-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["poker-odds-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Kalkulator ɗin na cire katunanka da tebur da ake gani daga ɗabi'ar ZXQPH0000QXZ-card deck, sa'an nan ya kwatanta mafi kyawun hannun poker na katunan biyar da kowane mai wasa zai iya yi. Tebur mai cikakke tare da mai adawa guda yana duba duk wani hannun katunan biyu da zai yiwu. Wasu lokutan na amfani da misalin Monte Carlo da aka dasa, don haka maɓallan shigar da aka dasa suna ba da ƙididdiga guda. Equity na ƙunshe da rabonka na pots da aka raba.","record_id":"5833ef44f3c48720a373ddcf287cd653bf07d33b88824844cd6db2894a6f4355","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":2.7182559244999993,"source":"The calculator removes your cards and the visible board from a standard 52-card deck, then compares the best five-card poker hand each player can make. A complete board with one opponent checks every possible two-card hand. Other cases use a seeded Monte Carlo sample, so the same inputs and seed give the same estimate. Equity includes your share of split pots.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"39a17806c17442407ed5167ae510f84c6c7dd7c32e02db37bc147339aa5826bf","status":"needs-review","translation":"Kalkulator ɗin na cire katunanka da tebur da ake gani daga ɗabi'ar 52-card deck, sa'an nan ya kwatanta mafi kyawun hannun poker na katunan biyar da kowane mai wasa zai iya yi. Tebur mai cikakke tare da mai adawa guda yana duba duk wani hannun katunan biyu da zai yiwu. Wasu lokutan na amfani da misalin Monte Carlo da aka dasa, don haka maɓallan shigar da aka das